  "m2_definition": {
    "id": "M2_current_gibraltar_generic_postcode_visualization",
    "definition": "Current Royal Gibraltar Post Office and UPU evidence establishes GX11 1AA as Gibraltar's single generic country-wide postcode and records the domestic E/V exception. A current rights-cleared Gibraltar territory Polygon/MultiPolygon is pinned by edition, validity, terms, SHA-256 and coverage, published as an approved immutable artifact, explicitly classified virtual rather than an official postal boundary, and passes the real GI loader, API and app search-to-translucent-area path. A government map or WFS without reproduction and distribution permission, address-register rows, parcels, buildings, points, synthetic fixtures and invented delivery zones never satisfy M2."
  },
